        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this exceptional four/five-bedroom detached home to the market at 7A St. Mary's Road, Drimnagh, Dublin 12. Newly constructed and finished to an outstanding standard throughout, this impressive A2-rated residence offers stylish, energy-efficient living in one of Dublin 12's most established and sought-after neighbourhoods. Presented in turnkey condition, No. 7A will appeal equally to families and investors, with strong rental potential in an area where demand for quality accommodation remains consistently high.\nDrimnagh remains one of Dublin's most popular residential suburbs, renowned for its strong community spirit and exceptional convenience while St. Mary's Road enjoys a prime location with an abundance of amenities nearby including shops, cafés, schools, parks and sporting facilities. Excellent public transport links are available, with the Red Line LUAS providing swift access to Dublin City Centre, while the M50 and N7 are easily accessible. Sundrive and Ashleaf Shopping Centres are both within easy reach, further enhancing the convenience of this superb address.\nExtending to approximately 131 sq.m. of bright and spacious accommodation, No. 7A has been thoughtfully designed to meet the demands of modern living. The flexible layout offers four or five bedrooms, making it ideal for both investors and scope for growing families. Built to the latest standards and benefiting from an A2 BER, the property combines contemporary finishes with outstanding energy efficiency and reduced running costs.\nFurther benefits include a fully alarmed security system, four externally mounted CCTV cameras and a highly desirable location. Combining immaculate presentation, convenience and excellent investment credentials, No. 7A St. Mary's Road represents a rare opportunity to acquire a superb detached home in a mature and well-connected setting. Early viewing is highly advised.\n\nFeatures\n<ul>\n <li>Newly built 4/5-bedroom detached family home\n• BER A2\n• Approx. 131 sq.m. of bright and spacious accommodation\n• Finished to a high standard throughout\n• Flexible layout ideal for modern family living\n• Excellent investment opportunity with strong rental potential\n• Suitable for owner-occupiers and investors alike\n• Potential for substantial rental income\n• High demand rental location close to Dublin City Centre\n• Excellent transport links attractive to tenants\n• Fully alarmed security system\n• Four CCTV cameras installed\n• Turnkey condition\n• Energy-efficient home with reduced running costs\n• Prime and highly sought-after residential location\n• Mature and well-established neighbourhood\n• Walking distance to a range of local amenities\n• Excellent public transport links including LUAS Red Line</li>\n</ul>"
      },
      {
